{"id":"t07-8a42b6","status":"read","groups":[{"levels":[[{"surface":"زهير بن حرب","kind":"narrator"},{"surface":"إسحاق بن إبراهيم","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"جرير","kind":"narrator","occurrence":1}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"إسحاق، بن إبراهيم","kind":"narrator"},{"surface":"علي بن خشرم","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"عيسى بن يونس","kind":"narrator"}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"أبو كريب، محمد بن العلاء","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"أبو معاوية","kind":"narrator"}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"أبو سعيد الأشج","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"حفص","kind":"narrator"}]]}],"shared_tail":[[{"surface":"الأعمش","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"زيد بن وهب","kind":"narrator"},{"surface":"أبي، ظبيان","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"جرير بن عبد الله","kind":"narrator"}]],"needs_ruling":false,"notes":["Four taḥwīl branches («ح»); «كلهم عن الأعمش، عن زيد بن وهب، وأبي، ظبيان عن جرير بن عبد الله» after the last «ح» is the shared tail.","The «جرير» of the first branch is Jarir b. Abd al-Hamid; the «جرير بن عبد الله» of the tail is the Companion: two men, two surfaces.","«أبي، ظبيان» is a kunya with a comma and a name: one man (rule 7)."],"fixes":[]}